          "type": "paragraph",
          "fontSize": null,
          "align": "center",
          "spaceBefore": 0,
          "spaceAfter": 1,
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "indent": 0,
          "inlines": [
            {
              "type": "math",
              "latex": "y=x^{2}-2(m+1)x+m^{2}+1.",
              "display": true
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p76-q7-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "Write the expression in vertex form.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$y=(x-m-1)^{2}-2m$.",
          "worked": "Complete the square:\n$$\\begin{align*}y&=x^{2}-2(m+1)x+m^{2}+1\\\\y&=(x-(m+1))^{2}-(m+1)^{2}+m^{2}+1\\\\y&=(x-m-1)^{2}-2m.\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 28
      },
      {
        "id": "p76-q7-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "State the vertex and minimum value in terms of $m$.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "Vertex $(m+1,-2m)$; minimum value $-2m$.",
          "worked": "From $y=(x-(m+1))^{2}-2m$, the vertex is $(m+1,-2m)$. The parabola opens upwards, so its minimum value is $-2m$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 14
      },
      {
        "id": "p76-q7-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "Determine the values of $m$ for which the graph has zero, one or two $x$-intercepts.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "Zero: $m<0$; one: $m=0$; two: $m>0$.",
          "worked": "The parabola opens upwards and has minimum value $-2m$.\n\nFor $m<0$, $-2m>0$, so there are no $x$-intercepts.\n\nFor $m=0$, the minimum value is $0$, so there is one $x$-intercept.\n\nFor $m>0$, $-2m<0$, so there are two $x$-intercepts.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 30
      },
      {
        "id": "p76-q7-d",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "d",
        "prompt": "Calculate the discriminant and explain why it gives exactly the same classification.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\Delta=8m$. Its sign gives zero intercepts for $m<0$, one for $m=0$ and two for $m>0$.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\Delta&=(-2(m+1))^{2}-4(m^{2}+1)\\\\\\Delta&=4(m+1)^{2}-4(m^{2}+1)\\\\\\Delta&=8m.\\end{align*}$$\nFor $m<0$, $\\Delta<0$, so there are no real intercepts. For $m=0$, $\\Delta=0$, so there is one intercept. For $m>0$, $\\Delta>0$, so there are two intercepts. These are exactly the cases in part c.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 36
      },
      {
        "id": "p76-q7-e",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "e",
        "prompt": "Find the $x$-intercepts when $m=8$.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$(5,0)$ and $(13,0)$.",
          "worked": {
            "format": "maths-editor-document-v1",
            "version": 1,
            "blocks": [
              {
                "id": "p76-q7-e-substitution",
                "type": "paragraph",
                "fontSize": null,
                "align": "left",
                "spaceBefore": 0,
                "spaceAfter": 2,
                "lineHeight": 1.4,
                "indent": 0,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "For ",
                    "marks": []
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "math",
                    "latex": "m=8",
                    "display": false
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": ", ",
                    "marks": []
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "math",
                    "latex": "y=(x-9)^{2}-16",
                    "display": false
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": ". Set ",
                    "marks": []
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "math",
                    "latex": "y=0",
                    "display": false
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": ":",
                    "marks": []
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "p76-q7-e-working",
                "type": "paragraph",
                "fontSize": null,
                "align": "left",
                "spaceBefore": 0,
                "spaceAfter": 2,
                "lineHeight": 1.4,
                "indent": 0,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "type": "math",
                    "latex": "\\begin{align*}(x-9)^{2}&=16\\\\x-9&=\\pm4\\\\x&=9\\pm4\\\\x&=5\\text{ or }x=13.\\end{align*}",
                    "display": true
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "p76-q7-e-intercepts",
                "type": "paragraph",
                "fontSize": null,
                "align": "left",
                "spaceBefore": 0,
                "spaceAfter": 2,
                "lineHeight": 1.4,
                "indent": 0,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "The ",
                    "marks": []
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "math",
                    "latex": "x",
                    "display": false
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "-intercepts are ",
                    "marks": []
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "math",
                    "latex": "(5,0)",
                    "display": false
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": " and ",
                    "marks": []
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "math",
                    "latex": "(13,0)",
                    "display": false
                  },
                  {
